resources.string:
① Tap "Open Preview" and grant camera permission on first use;
② Face the camera (frontal, evenly lit faces work best); a red box appears and tracks the face in real time;
③ Tap "Switch Camera" to toggle front/back; tracking resets and re-detects after switching;
④ Tap "Close Preview" or go back to the main screen to release the camera;
⑤ Note: Haar cascades are trained for frontal faces; profile views, occlusion, or long distances may cause missed detections.
